cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite it as below. The data is dedicated to the
  public domain (CC0 1.0), so citation is requested, not required.
title: "Boone County, Indiana Precinct-Level Election Results, 2008–2026"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Gollapudi
    given-names: Oliver
abstract: >-
  Precinct-level election results for Boone County, Indiana, parsed from the Boone
  County Clerk's official result reports for every election from 2008 onward
  (primaries, generals, municipal and special elections, all offices and public
  questions), validated against each report's own contest totals. Includes per-precinct
  turnout, results re-expressed on the 2021-enacted Indiana House, Indiana Senate and
  U.S. House districts using Census block voting-age population, results by the district
  lines in force at each election, static maps, and an interactive map.
repository-code: "https://github.com/olivergollapudi/boone-county-indiana-election-data"
url: "https://olivergollapudi.github.io/boone-county-indiana-election-data/"
license:
  - CC0-1.0
  - MIT
keywords:
  - elections
  - election results
  - precinct
  - Boone County
  - Indiana
  - redistricting
  - normalization
  - open data
